WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.536
March twenty twenty-one.

00:00:01.536 --> 00:00:03.147
Bill C-7.

00:00:03.147 --> 00:00:04.375
The death requirement?

00:00:04.375 --> 00:00:04.965
Gone.

00:00:04.965 --> 00:00:06.238
For everyone.

00:00:06.238 --> 00:00:07.602
Track Two is born.

00:00:07.602 --> 00:00:09.272
People with disabilities.

00:00:09.272 --> 00:00:10.477
Chronic pain.

00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:11.715
Mental suffering.

00:00:11.715 --> 00:00:14.488
You can request death and receive it the same day.

00:00:14.488 --> 00:00:15.545
Same day.

00:00:15.545 --> 00:00:16.875
No cooling off.

00:00:16.875 --> 00:00:18.863
No second opinion required.
